{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37920","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:43.345210+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Hi - thanks for the report! This is working as intended. `jax_enable_x64` does not mean \"produce 64-bit values everywhere it is possible to do so\", it means \"allow the creation of 64-bit values\".\n\nIn general, across the `jax.numpy` APIs JAX departs from NumPy in avoiding silently promoting inputs to 64-bit.","created_at":"2026-05-22T13:20:23Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/37920#issuecomment-4519035214","id":4519035214,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37920","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc8AAAABDVsBTg","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/4519035214/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-05-22T13:20:23Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/4519035214","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\n\n`jnp.cumsum` and `jnp.cumprod` preserve the input integer dtype (e.g., `int32 → int32`) even when `jax_enable_x64=True`. NumPy promotes `int8`, `int16`, and `int32` inputs to `int64` on a 64-bit platform. The values are correct for small inputs; the dtype is wrong.\n\nThis is inconsistent with `jnp.sum` and `jnp.prod`, which correctly return `int64` under x64 mode.\n\n```python\nimport jax\njax.config.update(\"jax_enable_x64\", True)\n\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nimport numpy as np\n\nx_np = np.array([1, 2, 3, 4, 5], dtype=np.int32)\nx    = jnp.array(x_np)\n\nprint(np.cumsum(x_np).dtype)   # int64  ← correct (NumPy)\nprint(jnp.cumsum(x).dtype)     # int32  ← BUG\n\nprint(np.cumprod(x_np).dtype)  # int64  ← correct (NumPy)\nprint(jnp.cumprod(x).dtype)    # int32  ← BUG\n\n# Scalar reductions are correct (for contrast):\nprint(jnp.sum(x).dtype)        # int64  ← correct\nprint(jnp.prod(x).dtype)       # int64  ← correct\n```\n\nThe mismatch affects all narrow integer types (`int8`, `int16`, `int32`) and violates the `jax_enable_x64` contract, which promises 64-bit NumPy behaviour. It also introduces silent overflow risk: cumulative operations accumulate values, so a short `int32` array whose prefix product fits in `int64` will silently wrap in `int32`:\n\n```python\nx = jnp.array([10_000, 10_000, 10_000], dtype=np.int32)\n# prefix products: 10_000 → 100_000_000 → 1_000_000_000_000\n# 1e12 overflows int32 (max ~2.1e9) → silent wrong result\nprint(jnp.cumprod(x))   # last element wraps, should be 1_000_000_000_000\n```\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n\n```\nJAX version:    0.10.1.dev20260513+64f6e229b\njaxlib version: (matching dev build)\nNumPy version:  2.4.4\nPython:         3.12.13\nPlatform:       macOS arm64\nAccelerator:    CPU\n```","closed_at":"2026-05-22T13:20:23Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37920/comments","created_at":"2026-05-22T02:36:19Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37920/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/37920","id":4499355546,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37920/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOCTkjjc8AAAABDC63mg","number":37920,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37920/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax","state":"closed","state_reason":"completed","sub_issues_summary":{"completed":0,"percent_completed":0,"total":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/re